Question. 4 Write a query to find the employee id, name (last_name) along with their manager_id and name (last_name).

SELECT 
    e.employee_id, 
    e.last_name, 
    e.manager_id, 
    m.last_name AS manager_last_name 
FROM employees e 
LEFT JOIN employees m 
    ON e.manager_id = m.employee_id;
